<p dir="auto"><strong>为什么必须有去重视图</strong>：<code>billboard</code> 主键是
<code>(trade_date, code, reason)</code>，一只股票同日因"日涨幅达15%"和
"日换手率达20%"两个原因上榜就会有<strong>两行</strong>。若直接
<code>seat_trade JOIN billboard</code>，这只股票的所有席位记录会被<strong>重复计数</strong>，
权重凭空翻倍。实测这会把可执行样本的 D1 从 <strong>+1.880% 拉偏到 +1.768%</strong>，
并让 DSR 从 0.9757（通过）掉到 0.9403（未通过）——<strong>足以改变结论</strong>。
（DSR 随历次缺陷修复从 0.9403 → 0.9679 → 0.9757 逐步上升，
每次都是修正 bug 而非挑参数，但这个变化轨迹本身值得读者警惕。）</p>
<p dir="auto">数据库是单个 SQLite 文件：<code>data/chaogu.db</code>。</p>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h4 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">signal_log（看板信号留痕）</h4><a id="user-content-signal_log看板信号留痕" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: signal_log（看板信号留痕）" href="#signal_log看板信号留痕"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">每次看板渲染都会写入当日候选，之后用真实行情回填。</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>列</th>
<th>含义</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>signal_date</code></td>
<td>看板给出信号的日子（<strong>收盘后</strong>才可计算）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>code</code> / <code>name</code> / <code>seat</code></td>
<td>标的与席位</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>rep_prob</code> / <code>activity</code></td>
<td>当时平台胜率、当时 60 日活跃度</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>entry_close</code></td>
<td>信号日收盘价。<strong>只是收益基准，不是你成交的价格</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>d1_ret</code> / <code>d5_ret</code> / <code>d10_ret</code></td>
<td>次日/5日/10日收盘涨幅%。<strong>NULL = 未来尚未发生，不是缺失</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>d1_locked</code></td>
<td>次日是否又涨停（1 = 买不进）。诚实性的关键一列</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir="auto">主键 <code>(signal_date, code)</code>，重复留痕幂等。
回填<strong>只填空字段</strong>，不重写已有值（否则"新填 N 条"的计数是假的）。</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">为什么不用 <code>seat_trade</code> 代替：<code>seat_trade</code> 是券商披露的<strong>事后</strong>数据，
本表记的是<strong>当时</strong>看板看到了什么。时间戳含义不同，混在一起无法审计。</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">八、调参</h2><a id="user-content-八调参" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: 八、调参" href="#八调参"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">所有阈值集中在 <code>chaogu/config.py</code>，方便按自己的理解校准。</p>
<p dir="auto">席位相关（新增）：</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-python notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="SEAT_MIN_REP_PROB  = 50.0   # 席位3日胜率下限（⚠️ 50 档净收益为负，见下）
SEAT_STRONG_REP_PROB = 60.0 # &quot;高胜率&quot;档（实测 D5 净 +2.71%）
SEAT_ELITE_REP_PROB  = 70.0 # &quot;最强&quot;档（实测 D5 净 +5.82%）
SEAT_MIN_TRADES    = 20     # 席位排名最少样本
SEAT_EVAL_DAYS     = 180    # 评估窗口（交易日）"><pre><span class="pl-c1">SEAT_MIN_REP_PROB</span>  <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-c1">50.0</span>   <span class="pl-c"># 席位3日胜率下限（⚠️ 50 档净收益为负，见下）</span>
<span class="pl-c1">SEAT_STRONG_REP_PROB</span> <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-c1">60.0</span> <span class="pl-c"># "高胜率"档（实测 D5 净 +2.71%）</span>
<span class="pl-c1">SEAT_ELITE_REP_PROB</span>  <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-c1">70.0</span> <span class="pl-c"># "最强"档（实测 D5 净 +5.82%）</span>
<span class="pl-c1">SEAT_MIN_TRADES</span>    <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-c1">20</span>     <span class="pl-c"># 席位排名最少样本</span>
<span class="pl-c1">SEAT_EVAL_DAYS</span>     <span class="pl-c1">=</span> <span class="pl-c1">180</span>    <span class="pl-c"># 评估窗口（交易日）</span></pre></div>
<p dir="auto"><strong><code>SEAT_MIN_REP_PROB=50</code> 是行为警戒线，不是推荐门槛。</strong>
50 档的可执行净收益为 D1 <strong>-0.70%</strong>、D5 <strong>-0.50%</strong>（亏的）。
它存在的意义是"低于 50 是明确的反向信号"。
实战门槛应用 <strong>60 或 70</strong>；<code>--follow</code> 默认走 60。</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-python notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="WEIGHTS          # 情绪温度分各指标权重（premium 默认 0.24 最高）
FALLBACK         # 冷启动时的绝对阈值（历史满 15 天后改用滚动分位数）
STAGE_BANDS      # 阶段分数区间
EBB_PREMIUM      # 退潮判定：溢价低于此值
DIVERGE_SEAL_RATE# 分歧判定：封板率低于此值
THEME_SCORE_WEIGHTS  # 题材延续性各分项权重
NEW_THEME_MIN_ZT     # 新题材最少涨停家数
FORECAST_NEIGHBORS   # 相似日邻居数"><pre><span class="pl-c1">WEIGHTS</span>          <span class="pl-c"># 情绪温度分各指标权重（premium 默认 0.24 最高）</span>
<span class="pl-c1">FALLBACK</span>         <span class="pl-c"># 冷启动时的绝对阈值（历史满 15 天后改用滚动分位数）</span>
<span class="pl-c1">STAGE_BANDS</span>      <span class="pl-c"># 阶段分数区间</span>
<span class="pl-c1">EBB_PREMIUM</span>      <span class="pl-c"># 退潮判定：溢价低于此值</span>
<span class="pl-c1">DIVERGE_SEAL_RATE</span><span class="pl-c"># 分歧判定：封板率低于此值</span>
<span class="pl-c1">THEME_SCORE_WEIGHTS</span>  <span class="pl-c"># 题材延续性各分项权重</span>
<span class="pl-c1">NEW_THEME_MIN_ZT</span>     <span class="pl-c"># 新题材最少涨停家数</span>
<span class="pl-c1">FORECAST_NEIGHBORS</span>   <span class="pl-c"># 相似日邻居数</span></pre></div>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">九、局限与风险（请认真读）</h2><a id="user-content-九局限与风险请认真读" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: 九、局限与风险（请认真读）" href="#九局限与风险请认真读"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<ol dir="auto">
<li><strong>工具不替你决策</strong>。它整理数据、计算指标、给出统计参考，
但买卖是你的决定，盈亏也是你的。</li>
<li><strong>历史相似不等于未来重演</strong>。预测模块输出的是"情绪处于类似位置时历史上通常怎么走"，
样本量小（几十到一两百天），且市场结构在变。</li>
<li><strong>A股短线生态已经和十年前不同</strong>。量化资金占比大幅提升，
打板/接力的结构性胜率下降。即使完全复制某个游资前辈的方法，
在今天的市场里也未必有当时的赔率。</li>
<li><strong>幸存者偏差</strong>。成名的游资是幸存者，用同样方法爆仓的人不会出名。
把成功者当唯一样本会严重高估胜率。</li>
<li><strong>数据可能有误</strong>。第三方公开接口，存在延迟、缺失、口径差异。
跌停家数在历史回填时是<strong>近似值</strong>（按板块阈值推算，未剔除 ST）。</li>
<li><strong>短线是负和游戏</strong>。扣掉手续费和冲击成本，多数参与者长期亏损。</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">十、免责声明</h2><a id="user-content-十免责声明" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: 十、免责声明" href="#十免责声明"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">本项目仅用于交易复盘与个人研究，<strong>不构成任何投资建议</strong>。
数据来源于第三方公开接口，可能存在延迟、缺失或错误，请以交易所及券商行情为准。
短线交易风险极高，请自行承担全部决策后果。</p>
</article></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="prc-PageLayout-PaneWrapper-pHPop pr-2" style="--offset-header:0px;--spacing-row:var(--spacing-none);--spacing-column:var(--spacing-none)" data-is-hidden="false" data-position="end"><div class="prc-PageLayout-HorizontalDivider-JLVqp prc-PageLayout-PaneHorizontalDivider-9tbnE" data-component="PageLayout.HorizontalDivider" data-variant-narrow="none" data-variant-regular="none" data-position="end" style="--spacing-divider:var(--spacing-none);--spacing:var(--spacing-none)"></div><div class="prc-PageLayout-Pane-AyzHK" data-component="SplitPageLayout.Pane" style="--spacing:var(--spacing-normal);--pane-min-width:256px;--pane-max-width:calc(100vw - var(--pane-max-width-diff));--pane-width-size:var(--pane-width-large);--pane-width:320px"><!--&--><div class="borderGrid__VCnF9i"><div class="sidebarSection__oqw6Y8 HideWhenNarrow__nfGOuR border-0"><h2 class="sectionHeading__4n11uG prc-Heading-Heading-MtWFE" data-variant="small" data-component="Heading"><span>About</span></h2><p class="description__ej4leF prc-Text-Text-9mHv3" data-component="Text">持续运行的 A 股市场数据与复盘看板</p><h3 class="sr-only prc-Heading-Heading-MtWFE" data-component="Heading"><span>Resources</span></h3><div class="mt-2"><a class="prc-Link-Link-9ZwDx" data-component="Link" data-muted="true" href="#readme-ov-file"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-book mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M0 1.75A.75.75 0 0 1 .75 1h4.253c1.227 0 2.317.59 3 1.501A3.743 3.743 0 0 1 11.006 1h4.245a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v10.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75h-4.507a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-1.591.659l-.622.621a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0l-.622-.621A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.258 13H.75a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Zm7.251 10.324.004-5.073-.002-2.253A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.003 2.5H1.5v9h3.757a3.75 3.75 0 0 1 1.994.574ZM8.755 4.75l-.004 7.322a3.752 3.752 0 0 1 1.99